# Local SQLite dev database and legacy media uploads. Neither is
# committed (the live site runs on Neon Postgres via DATABASE_URL,
# and bird photos live in bird_database/ and are served via
# /bird-images/), so ignoring them cannot deploy an empty site.
db.sqlite3
website/media/

